       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    PAYPROC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  FIBERNET - PAYMENT PROCESSING                                  
      *  FUNCTION : Accept a payment against an open bill, record it in 
      *             PAYMAST and update the paid amount / status on      
      *             BILLMAST (O=open, R=part-paid, P=fully paid).       
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT BILLMAST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-BILLMAST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-BILL-STS.
           SELECT PAYMAST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-PAYMAST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-PAY-STS.
           SELECT CTLFILE ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CTLFILE
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CTL-STS.
           SELECT DSPF ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-PAYPROCD-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  BILLMAST LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF BILLMAST.
       FD  PAYMAST  LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF PAYMAST.
       FD  CTLFILE  LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF CTLFILE.
       FD  DSPF     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF PAYPROCD.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-STATUS-FLAGS.
           05  WS-BILL-STS     PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-PAY-STS      PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-CTL-STS      PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-DSP-STS      PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-INDIC.
           05  EXIT-KEY        PIC 1 INDICATOR 03 VALUE B"0".
           05  CANCEL-KEY      PIC 1 INDICATOR 12 VALUE B"0".
       01  WS-FOUND-SW         PIC X(01) VALUE "N".
           88  REC-FOUND                 VALUE "Y".
           88  REC-NOTFOUND              VALUE "N".
       01  WS-BALANCE          PIC 9(09)V99 VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-NXTPAY           PIC 9(09) VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-CURR-DATE        PIC X(21).
       01  WS-TODAY            PIC 9(08) VALUE ZEROS.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       000-MAIN.
           OPEN I-O BILLMAST.
           OPEN I-O PAYMAST.
           OPEN I-O CTLFILE.
           OPEN I-O DSPF.
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-CURR-DATE.
           MOVE WS-CURR-DATE(1:8) TO WS-TODAY.
           PERFORM 100-PROCESS UNTIL EXIT-KEY = B"1".
           CLOSE BILLMAST PAYMAST CTLFILE DSPF.
           GOBACK.

       100-PROCESS.
           MOVE SPACES TO MSGTXT.
           MOVE ZEROS  TO PBILLNO OF PAYPMT.
           WRITE PAYPMT.
           READ DSPF.
           IF EXIT-KEY = B"1"
               GO TO 100-EXIT
           END-IF.
           MOVE PBILLNO OF PAYPMT TO BILLNO.
           PERFORM 200-READ-BILL.
           IF REC-NOTFOUND
               MOVE "Bill not found." TO MSGTXT
               GO TO 100-EXIT
           END-IF.
           IF BILLSTS = "P"
               MOVE "Bill is already fully paid." TO MSGTXT
               GO TO 100-EXIT
           END-IF.
           PERFORM 300-SHOW-AND-PAY.
       100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       200-READ-BILL.
           READ BILLMAST
               INVALID KEY     SET REC-NOTFOUND TO TRUE
               NOT INVALID KEY SET REC-FOUND    TO TRUE
           END-READ.
       200-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       300-SHOW-AND-PAY.
           COMPUTE WS-BALANCE = BILLAMT OF BILLREC - BPAID OF BILLREC.
           MOVE BCUSTID          TO PCUSTID OF PAYDTL.
           MOVE BILLAMT OF BILLREC TO BILLAMT OF PAYDTL.
           MOVE BPAID   OF BILLREC TO BPAID   OF PAYDTL.
           MOVE WS-BALANCE       TO BALDUE.
           MOVE WS-BALANCE       TO PAYAMT OF PAYDTL.
           MOVE SPACES           TO PAYMODE OF PAYDTL.
           MOVE SPACES           TO PAYREF  OF PAYDTL.
           WRITE PAYDTL.
           READ DSPF.
           IF EXIT-KEY = B"1" OR CANCEL-KEY = B"1"
               GO TO 300-EXIT
           END-IF.
           IF PAYAMT OF PAYDTL = ZEROS
              OR PAYAMT OF PAYDTL > WS-BALANCE
               MOVE "Invalid pay amount (must be 1..balance)." TO MSGTXT
               GO TO 300-EXIT
           END-IF.
           PERFORM 400-WRITE-PAYMENT.
           PERFORM 500-UPDATE-BILL.
           MOVE "Payment posted successfully." TO MSGTXT.
       300-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       400-WRITE-PAYMENT.
           PERFORM 600-NEXT-PAYNO.
           INITIALIZE PAYREC.
           MOVE WS-NXTPAY        TO PAYNO.
           MOVE BILLNO           TO PBILLNO OF PAYREC.
           MOVE BCUSTID          TO PCUSTID OF PAYREC.
           MOVE WS-TODAY         TO PAYDT.
           MOVE PAYAMT  OF PAYDTL TO PAYAMT  OF PAYREC.
           MOVE PAYMODE OF PAYDTL TO PAYMODE OF PAYREC.
           MOVE PAYREF  OF PAYDTL TO PAYREF  OF PAYREC.
           WRITE PAYREC.
       400-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       500-UPDATE-BILL.
           ADD PAYAMT OF PAYDTL TO BPAID OF BILLREC.
           IF BPAID OF BILLREC >= BILLAMT OF BILLREC
               MOVE "P" TO BILLSTS
           ELSE
               MOVE "R" TO BILLSTS
           END-IF.
           REWRITE BILLREC.
       500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       600-NEXT-PAYNO.
           MOVE "1" TO CTLID.
           READ CTLFILE
               INVALID KEY
                   MOVE 1000 TO NXTCUST
                   MOVE 1    TO NXTBILL NXTPAY NXTCMP
                   WRITE CTLREC
           END-READ.
           MOVE NXTPAY TO WS-NXTPAY.
           ADD 1 TO NXTPAY.
           REWRITE CTLREC.
       600-EXIT.
           EXIT.
